  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Assistance Program for Planting in Floriculture&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to encourage floriculture in Gujarat by offering financial support to farmers cultivating various types of flowers. The assistance amount varies depending on the type of flower and whether the farmer is classified as a small/marginal or other category.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a farmer.\n   1. The applicant must be engaged in floriculture farming (loose, cut, or tuberous flowers).\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
